---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Self-Employed Health Insurance Deduction Calculator" description="Calculate your allowable tax deduction and estimated tax savings for health insurance premiums as a freelancer.">
  <main class="container">
    <h1>Self-Employed Health Insurance Deduction</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">See how much of your health premiums you can deduct and the tax savings you unlock.</p>

    <div class="calc-box">
      <div class="input-group">
        <label>Annual Net Profit ($)</label>
        <input type="number" id="profit" placeholder="e.g. 60000" />
      </div>
      <div class="input-group">
        <label>Annual Health Premiums Paid ($)</label>
        <input type="number" id="premiums" placeholder="e.g. 8000" />
      </div>
      <button id="calcBtn">Calculate Deduction</button>
      <div id="result" class="hidden result-box">
        <p class="total">Allowable Deduction: <strong id="deduction"></strong></p>
        <p class="sub">Adjusted Net Profit: <span id="adjustedProfit"></span></p>
        <p class="sub">Estimated Tax Savings (at 25%): <span id="taxSavings" style="color: #16a34a; font-weight: bold;"></span></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="article-content">
      <h2>The Self-Employed Health Insurance Deduction</h2>
      <p>If you are self-employed, you can deduct the premiums you paid for medical, dental, and long-term care insurance for yourself, your spouse, and your dependents. This is known as the self-employed health insurance deduction.</p>
      
      <h2>How the Math Works</h2>
      <p>You can deduct the full amount of your premiums, but the deduction is <strong>limited to your net self-employment profit</strong>. If you made $5,000 in profit but paid $8,000 in premiums, you can only deduct $5,000.</p>
      <p>This deduction lowers your Adjusted Gross Income (AGI), which means you pay less income tax. Our calculator estimates your tax savings assuming a 25% marginal tax bracket, which is a common bracket for middle-income freelancers.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  document.getElementById('calcBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const profit = parseFloat(document.getElementById('profit').value);
    const premiums = parseFloat(document.getElementById('premiums').value);
    
    if (isNaN(profit) || isNaN(premiums) || profit < 0 || premiums < 0) { 
      alert("Please enter valid positive numbers."); 
      return; 
    }

    // The IRS rule: You cannot deduct more than your net profit.
    const deduction = Math.min(profit, premiums);
    
    // How much of the profit is left after the deduction?
    const adjustedProfit = profit - deduction;

    // Assuming a 25% tax bracket for estimate
    const taxSavings = deduction * 0.25;

    document.getElementById('deduction').innerText = "$" + deduction.toFixed(2);
    document.getElementById('adjustedProfit').innerText = "$" + adjustedProfit.toFixed(2);
    document.getElementById('taxSavings').innerText = "$" + taxSavings.toFixed(2);
    
    document.getElementById('result').classList.remove('hidden');
  });
</script>

<style>
  .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 16px; }
  h1 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 8px; } 
  .subtitle { text-align: center; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  
  .calc-box { background: white; padding: 24px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); max-width: 400px; margin: 32px auto; }
  .input-group { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .input-group label { display: block; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .input-group input { width: 100%; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 4px; box-sizing: border-box; }
  button { width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: #2563eb; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; }
  button:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }
  
  .result-box { margin-top: 24px; padding: 16px; background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius: 4px; }
  .hidden { display: none; }
  .total { font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-weight: bold; }
  .sub { font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; margin: 6px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
  
  .article-content { margin-top: 40px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .article-content h2 { margin-top: 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; }
</style>
